fluid) under a N$_2$ atmosphere and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Autoclave at 121C for 30 min. For agar slants, use 15 g agar per 1.0
L medium. Alternatively, commercially available Cooked Meat Medium may be
used (Oxoid CM81; Merck 10928; Difco 0267--01--7). The medium should be
supplemented with 5 g/L yeast extract, 5 g/L K$_2$HPO$_4$, 1 mg/L resazurin, and 0.5
g/L L--cysteine$\cdot$HCl$\cdot$H$_2$O.}

