to the medium.  Filter--sterilize Trace vitamins and NaHCO$_3$ (8\%) solution and
add to the medium.  Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days.
Distribute the medium into culture vessels containing sulfur under a N$_2$--CO$_2$
(4:1, v/v) gas mixture and seal with butyl rubber stoppers.  Before
inoculation, reduce the medium with 5\% Na$_2$S$\cdot$9H$_2$O solution (autoclaved under
a N$_2$ atmosphere).  Readjust pH to 7.2, if necessary.}

